                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amubone! Kuyooba mwami uuendelezya mubululami abasilutwe babeteka cakululama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umwi aumwi uyooba mbuli macijilo aakulivuna kumuuwo aciyubilo cakucijila ciindi cakuwidwa imvula yamuyoba. Uyooba mbuli tulongalonga twamaanzi munkanda injumu, mbuli cenzule campangala impati munyika iikataazya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.29.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Is 29:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino meso aabaabo babona taakooyoofwinyisigwa, amatwi aabaabo bamvwa ayooswiililisya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Moyo wamuntu uubinzya makani uyooswiilila luzibo, alulimi lwasicibebe luyoofwamba kwaamba cakuswiililika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mufubafuba takooyooambwa limbi kuti watembaulika, alakwe sikweena takooyooambwa kuti ngumulemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkaambo mufubafuba ulaamba bufubafuba, amoyo wakwe ulacita bubi, kuti acite masampu, aambe aa-Jehova zyakubeja, aimikwe uufwa inzala cilyo akukasya oyo uufwa nyota kunywa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sikweena zibelesyo zyakwe nzibi. Ulayeeya makanze mabi kuti anyonyoone babombumyoyo amajwi aakubeja, nekuba kuti mubombumoyo ulaamba makani aaluleme. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 32:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pele mulemu nguuyeeya makanze aalemekeka, nkabela mpoonya awo amakanze aalemekeka mpayooima nji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.32.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.32.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
